+\[
+\eta_{\rm cost}(N)=N\,\theta_{\rm cost}(0)+\kappa_{\rm cost}I_0+O\!\left(\frac{I_0^2}{N}\right),
+\qquad
+\kappa_{\rm cost}=-\left.\frac{\partial J/\partial i_0}{\partial J/\partial\theta}\right|_{(\theta_{\rm cost}(0),\,0)}.
+\]
